// Turbo
// Borland Turbo Pascal 7.0 / Turbo C IDE - the iconic DOS development environment
// Deep blue backgrounds, bright yellow text, cyan accents, TEAL menu bars
// Primary accent: Yellow #FFFF00, Secondary accent: Cyan #00FFFF for automation
// Flat knobs (no emboss) for authentic DOS aesthetic
// Author: Claude

